[QUESTIONS]

Q4. Who reviews each completed assessment, and what will they refuse to accept?

  Selecting a refusal ratifies it as your standard. Any combination.

  Reviewer   A. The AP manager
             B. A second AP analyst
             C. Someone else → name them

