             I. Reject
             J. Send back for rework

  Both a reviewer and an authority are needed. Reply like: "4A DEFG J"
  Or describe your own review arrangement.

Q5. Which determinations may an AP analyst act on without a second signature?

  A. Passes only
  B. Passes and holds
  C. All three, including escalations
