Q6. What must every completed assessment contain?

  A. Determination, exceptions triggered, variance figures, PO and GRN references,
     duplicate-match reference, decision trail
  B. That set, plus vendor payment terms and due date
  C. I'll list the fields myself

Reply with letters — e.g. "1B 2A 3C".

[OTHER ACTIONS AVAILABLE]

• Type your own answer
  Use your own wording instead of any option.

• Skip a question
  Perfection will continue, but that unanswered item may need to be provided later
  before the workflow can make certain decisions.

• Compile now
  Build the prompt using the information currently available.

• Switch to fast mode
